b_paragraph\">Equipment and Items may be purchased, found or won. Special items may be found, such as magic potions, the fabled &quot;Goblin in a bottle&quot;, magic weapons, armours and trinkets. Start off with basic armour and weapons, progress equipping more powerful items. Only the best armour and weapons will give your gladiators a change to beat the mighty arena bosses or the best Gladiator teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651430/extras/b2b2473314d086c2d822edcfb2cd45dd.avif?t=1752669987\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Entice local Traders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levelling up the market will encourage better and more traders to visit your town. These in turn will bring more unusual and powerful items to trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651430/extras/76c7f6654694a423d8b797b198870f30.poster.avif?t=1752669987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651430/extras/76c7f6654694a423d8b797b198870f30.webm?t=1752669987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651430/extras/76c7f6654694a423d8b797b198870f30.mp4?t=1752669987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only the greatest Gladiators will obtain Immortality </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your Gladiators climb up the leagues learning fame and fortune they will eventually encounter the ultimate challenger, one of the Gods immortals. If they can beat them then they will take their place amongst the God's elite warriors and earn immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">